p survival show Produce 101. She is a former member of the girl groups I.O.I and Gugudan, as well as its subgroups 5959 and SeMiNa. Kang is also best known for her roles in the television series Dokgo Rewind (2018), Tale of Fairy (2018), Hotel del Luna (2019), Summer Guys (2021), Moonshine (2021–2022), Café Minamdang (2022), Welcome to Samdal-ri (2023), and See You at Work Tomorrow! (2026).","title":"Kang Mi-na","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kang_Mi-na"}},"Q25842431":{"id":"Q25842431","name":"Lee Jin-sol","ko":"이진솔","birthName":"이진솔","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Lee Jinsol","Lee Jin Sol"],"birth":"2001-12-04","death":"","birthplace":"Andong","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":170,"occupations":["singer","pop singer"],"debut":"2015","agencies":[],"groups":[{"id":"Q20858387","name":"April","start":"2015","end":"2022"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/truesol__0824/","x":"https://x.com/truesol__","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/57a0555d-9c88-4fe3-80b9-bbd991c25cf6"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"April was a South Korean girl group formed by DSP Media. The group debuted on August 24, 2015, with their EP Dreaming and its title track \"Dream Candy\". The group's final lineup was composed of six members: Chaekyung, Chaewon, Naeun, Yena, Rachel, and Jinsol. The group officially disbanded on January 28, 2022.","title":"Lee Jin-sol","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lee_Jin-sol"}},"Q26220991":{"id":"Q26220991","name":"Jae Park","ko":"Jae","birthName":"Park Jae-hyung","birthNameEn":"Park Jae-hyung","aliases":["eaJ","Park Jae-hyung"],"birth":"1992-09-15","death":"","birthplace":"Buenos Aires","nationality":["South Korea","United States"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","songwriter","composer"],"debut":"2015","agencies":[{"name":"JYP Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q483238","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q20898046","name":"Day6","start":"2015","end":"2021"}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/eajpark/","x":"https://x.com/eaJPark","youtube":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCrOUYIN9rbYaWFs68vAtaZA","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/f53e21b8-0806-41ce-a483-b6bce9811d29"},"photo":null,"bio":{"text":"Park Jae-hyung, known professionally as Jae Park, Jae or eaJ (제이), is an American singer, songwriter, and former member of the South Korean pop rock band Day6. He gained early recognition by competing in the first season of K-pop Star in 2012, where he finished in sixth place before signing with JYP Entertainment. Park debuted as the lead guitarist and vocalist of Day6 in September 2015 and was with the group until his departure in December 2021. In addition to his work with Day6, Park pursued a solo career under the stage name eaJ, launching the eaJ Project in 2020, where he released several self-written tracks on YouTube and SoundCloud.","title":"Jae Park","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jae_Park"}},"Q27953983":{"id":"Q27953983","name":"Kim Minkyeung","ko":"김민경","birthName":"김민경","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Roa","Minkyeung","Kim Min-kyeung"],"birth":"1997-07-29","death":"","birthplace":"Seoul","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer"],"debut":"","agencies":[{"name":"Pledis Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q45282","start":"","end":""}],"groups":[{"id":"Q26265886","name":"Pristin","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q54033722","name":"Pristin V","start":"","end":""},{"id":"Q72188524","name":"HINAPIA","start":"","end":""}],"links":{"instagram":"https://www.instagram.com/minkyeung_729/","musicbrainz":"https://musicbrainz.org/artist/b797ae51-0b89-4360-8b58-d4c1176fd566"},"photo":null,"bio":null},"Q28746303":{"id":"Q28746303","name":"Minhyuk","ko":"민혁 (가수)","birthName":"이민혁","birthNameEn":"","aliases":["Lee Min-hyuk"],"birth":"1993-11-03","death":"","birthplace":"Uijeongbu","nationality":["South Korea"],"height":null,"occupations":["singer","actor"],"debut":"2015","agencies":[{"name":"Starship Entertainment","korean":true,"id":"Q255363","star